An existing directory whose mask matches no file is an error, not an empty report, and the message
names both the mask and the root that was walked.

-- fixtures/cwd/vault/plan/index.md --
---
sessions: []
---

Body.
-- cmd --
booping session-stats vault --mask 'M*.md'
-- exit --
1
-- stdout --
-- stderr --
error: no artifact matching 'M*.md' under vault
